#
# Counter-example for math:ContinuousMapShape: a math:ContinuousMap that does not declare
# math:isContinuous (sh:minCount 1) — continuity assumed from the type, not declared.
# Validation MUST emit shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent (math:UndeclaredTopologicalProperty).
# Bound by ex:ecMapContinuityAssumed.
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:assumedMap a math:ContinuousMap .
